sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant L as Leader
  participant S as Sync follower
  participant A as Async follower
  C->>L: UPDATE … COMMIT
  L->>L: write WAL
  L->>S: stream WAL
  S-->>L: flushed ✓
  L-->>C: COMMIT ok
  L--)A: stream WAL (later)
  Note over A: may lag ms … s
  C->>A: SELECT (read replica)
